job_description:
Requirements :

·         Pendidikan minimal S1 Marketing, Manajemen, Statistik, Ekonomi, atau bidang terkait;

·         Memiliki pengalaman minimal 1–3 tahun sebagai Marketing Analyst, Market Research, atau Data Analyst;

·         Memiliki kemampuan analisa data yang baik dan berpikir secara analytical dan detail oriented;

·         Menguasai Microsoft Excel (Pivot Table, VLOOKUP, Data Analysis);

·         Memiliki kemampuan komunikasi dan presentasi yang baik;

·         Mampu bekerja secara individu maupun dalam tim;

·         Terbiasa bekerja dengan target, laporan berkala, dan deadline pekerjaan.

 

Job Description :

·         Mengumpulkan, mengolah, dan menganalisis data penjualan, pasar, dan perilaku pelanggan;

·         Melakukan analisis tren pasar, aktivitas kompetitor, serta peluang pengembangan pasar;

·         Membuat laporan analisis performa produk, termasuk analisa SKU dan product mix;

·         Menyusun laporan forecasting penjualan dan rekomendasi strategi pemasaran berbasis data;

·         Mengevaluasi efektivitas program promosi dan aktivitas marketing perusahaan.

·         Menyusun laporan analisis secara berkala untuk manajemen;

·         Berkoordinasi dengan tim Sales, Marketing, dan Manajemen untuk mendukung pengambilan keputusan strategis;

·         Melakukan tracking performa Sales;

·         Telemarketing;

·         Menyusun notulen rapat (minutes of meeting).

About the role

PT Solaris Scientific Indonesia is seeking a dedicated and skilled Laboratory Personnel to join our team in Yogyakarta, Indonesia. This full-time position will play a vital role in supporting our laboratory operations and contributing to the successful delivery of our scientific and technical services.

What we're looking for

Personnel: Responsible for the preparation, cultivation, cryopreservation and distribution of cell products in accordance with the requirements of SOP documents;

Responsible for the maintenance and inventory management of the cell preparation plant;

Responsible for the maintenance of equipment and facilities used in the preparation of cell;

Responsible for the formulation and optimization of cell product process SOP;

Able to perform QC or QA tasks are also welcomed:

According to the work arrangement and testing standards, responsible for the testing of cells and related samples, as well as the detection and solution of abnormalities;

Responsible for the timely filling of the records of the items tested;

Assist the superior to develop the cell testing plan of this testing platform;

Responsible for the inventory and usage statistics of the materials of the testing;

Responsible for the maintenance and management of equipment, participating in the reception, installation and commissioning of newly purchased equipment.

According to the requirements of the process and quality standards, responsible to the whole cell preparation process’ quality monitoring;

Check whether the abnormal phenomena occurring in each production process are handled according to relevant regulations, investigate and analyse the deviation, give reasonable treatment suggestions, and track the treatment effect;

Review the original production records, and provide a basis for judging whether the production process meets the requirements of the process standards and whether the finished products can be released;

Collect and organize work data and improve risk management.

What we offer

At PT Solaris Scientific Indonesia, we are committed to providing a supportive and rewarding work environment for our employees. We offer competitive remuneration, opportunities for professional development, and a range of benefits to support your well-being and work-life balance.

Job Requirements

Candidate must possess at least Bachelor’s Degree/Post Graduate Diploma/Professional Degree in Engineering (Bioengineering/Biomedical), Biology, Biotechnology or equivalent.

At least 1 Year(s) of working experience in the related field is required for this position.

Required Skill(s): Familiar with cGMP standards

Preferably Junior Executive specialized in Science & Technology/Laboratory or equivalent.

About us

PT Solaris Scientific Indonesia is a leading provider of innovative scientific and technical services, supporting a wide range of industries with our expertise in laboratory analysis, product testing, and research and development. Our mission is to drive scientific progress and contribute to the advancement of knowledge and technology. Join our dynamic team and be a part of our exciting journey.

Apply now for this exciting opportunity to become our next Laboratory Personnel.

Deskripsi Pekerjaan What you'll do
Develop and Implement Dashboarding Best Practices: Lead the standardization and centralization of dashboarding frameworks, ensuring consistent, insightful, and user-friendly visualizations across teams;
Empower Self-Serve Analytics: Collaborate with stakeholders to design and deploy scalable, intuitive analytics solutions and tools, enabling teams to access and interpret data independently;
Optimize ETL Pipelines for Scalability: Build and maintain efficient ETL processes to ensure reliable, accurate, and timely delivery of data to support analytics and reporting needs;
Develop and maintain reliable data models to support key business metrics;
Create and implement processes to ensure data quality and accuracy;
Handle data discovery, exploration, and insights generation for business and product improvements;
Experience in coaching, guiding and leading projects alongside junior team members.
What you'll need
4+ years of data analytics experience;
Bachelor’s degree in System Information, Computer Science, Mathematics, Statistics, or related fields from a reputable university;
Advanced SQL and data manipulation skills;
Data wrangling experience with Python/R;
Advanced Excel knowledge;
Good experience with one or more databases like Snowflake, BigQuery, Redshift, Postgres, Oracle, Teradata, MySQL etc;
Excellent data visualization skills using Tableau/Looker or other data visualization tools;
Detail-oriented with a focus on accuracy.

Menyediakan dan menganalisis data penjualan untuk mengidentifikasi tren;

Memantau KPI (seperti target vs realisasi);

Memberikan rekomendasi strategis guna meningkatkan performa penjualan;

Supporting team sales untuk mengolah data penjualan historis dan riil menjadi insight strategis untuk meningkatkan efektivitas penjualan;

Mengoptimalkan penjualan;

Membantu manajemen mengambil keputusan berbasis data.
